{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sJ7BgcTX3i1793023800.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名男子涉嫌在石硤尾公園放置老鼠藥在貓糧內，被控企圖虐畜等三項控罪，案件在西九龍裁判法院提堂。</p><p></p><p>34歲被告何睿璋，被控本月18及24日，在石硤尾公園網球場旁企圖殘忍地對待動物，警方在他身上搜出一包老鼠藥。另搜出一把刀，控以一項藏有攻擊性武器。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CAT-1800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Kha1h21fns1793023813.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>裁判官陳慧敏將案押後至明年1月18日再訊，以待警方進一步調查。被告獲准以一萬元保釋，不得離港或返回案發地點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:13.749159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:15.093890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:21.867398+00:00","content_hash":"5abc2ac849cc2b285e81999bf7f961fb4a7d988bef4dd775a3be0c0330f91c5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:13.749159+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}